ted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Submitting author:** <!--author-handle-->@gtrevisan<!--end-author-handle--> (<a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-4920-6109\">Gregorio L. Trevisan</a>)\n**Repository:** <!--target-repository-->https://github.com/MIT-PSFC/disruption-py<!--end-target-repository-->\n**Branch with paper.md** (empty if default branch): <!--branch-->glt/joss<!--end-branch-->\n**Version:** <!--version-->v0.14.0<!--end-version-->\n**Editor:** <!--editor-->@jatkinson1000<!--end-editor-->\n**Reviewers:** <!--reviewers-list-->@LiamPattinson, @jackleland, @rmrsk<!--end-reviewers-list-->\n**Archive:** <!--archive-->10.5281/zenodo.19051387<!--end-archive-->\n\n## Status\n\n[![status](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/e98dd4586a1383f120c5005b539ca6f8/status.svg)](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/e98dd4586a1383f120c5005b539ca6f8)\n\nStatus badge code:\n\n```\nHTML: <a href=\"https://joss.theoj.org/papers/e98dd4586a1383f120c5005b539ca6f8\"><img src=\"https://joss.theoj.org/papers/e98dd4586a1383f120c5005b539ca6f8/status.svg\"></a>\nMarkdown: [![status](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/e98dd4586a1383f120c5005b539ca6f8/status.svg)](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/e98dd4586a1383f120c5005b539ca6f8)\n```\n**Reviewers and authors**:\n\nPlease avoid lengthy details of difficulties in the review thread. Instead, please create a new issue in the <a href=\"https://github.com/MIT-PSFC/disruption-py\" target=\"_blank\">target repository</a> and link to those issues (especially acceptance-blockers) by leaving comments in the review thread below. (For completists: if the target issue tracker is also on GitHub, linking the review thread in the issue or vice versa will create corresponding breadcrumb trails in the link target.)\n\n## Reviewer instructions & questions\n\n@LiamPattinson & @jackleland & @rmrsk, your review will be checklist based. Each of you will have a separate checklist that you should update when carrying out your review.\nFirst of all you need to run this command in a separate comment to create the checklist:\n\n```\n@editorialbot generate my checklist\n```\n\nThe reviewer guidelines are available here: https://joss.readthedocs.io/en/pre-2026-submission/reviewer_guidelines.html. Any questions/concerns please let @jatkinson1000 know.\n\n✨ **Please start on your review when you are able, and be sure to complete your review in the next six weeks, at the very latest** ✨ \n\n\n## Checklists\n\n<!--checklist-comments-->\n<!--checklist-for-liampattinson-->\n📝 [Checklist for @LiamPattinson](https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9364#issuecomment-3497412913)\n<!--end-checklist-for-liampattinson-->\n<!--checklist-for-jackleland-->\n📝 [Checklist for @jackleland](https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9364#issuecomment-3497446641)\n<!--end-checklist-for-jackleland-->\n<!--checklist-for-rmrsk-->\n📝 [Checklist for @rmrsk](https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9364#issuecomment-3497474843)\n<!--end-checklist-for-rmrsk-->\n<!--end-checklist-comments-->\n","closed_by":{"login":"kyleniemeyer","id":190432,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MDQzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190432?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyleniemeyer","html_url":"https://github.com/kyleniemeyer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyleniemeyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyleniemeyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyleniemeyer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyleniemeyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyleniemeyer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyleniemeyer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyleniemeyer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyleniemeyer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":